Create a pie chart showing `share_pct` for each `crop_variety`. Use `share_pct`, not `planted_hectares` or `yield_tons`. Do not use `crop_family` for the slice categories. Add the title `Crop Share by Variety`. Include a legend. Use colors `#4c78a8`, `#f58518`, `#54a24b`, `#e45756`, and `#72b7b2`.

Full data input from "benchmark/package/datasets/T11.json":
